<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 72.9613 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 72.9613 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 72.9613 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 73.1547 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				   Dec 25		   Dec 24</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	 72.9613		  73.1547</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	    8.390		    6.785</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
